# Vulnerabilities in the Debian stable base image's packages, not in
# VOTPort. The runtime stage runs one server binary plus curl for its
# healthcheck: none of these packages' vulnerable code paths (mount,
# nsenter, pam login, perl, the sqlite shell, ncurses) execute here, and
# Debian has not published fixed packages for any of them yet. Each entry
# is dropped when a base digest carrying its fix is available.
